// OAKES_OILSPILL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3678033325" "Nothing to report here, sir."
// OAKES_OILSPILL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1655153218" "Oil Spill is clear on this end, sir."
// OAKES_OILSPILL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1970666191" "Did you hear something?"

// OAKES_OILSPILL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1505181545" "Maintain our position!  Take them out!"
// OAKES_OILSPILL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4221349933" "Get them!"
// OAKES_OILSPILL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P431039555" "You have your orders!  Take care of it!"
// OAKES_OILSPILL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2898020201" "Maintain position and clear the area!"

// OAKES_OILSPILL_SHIPMENT_CRATEMOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2752943188" "This shipment is important.  Mind where you're walking!"
// OAKES_OILSPILL_SHIPMENT_CRATEMOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1366570942" "Coming through.  This stuff isn't light."
// OAKES_OILSPILL_SHIPMENT_CRATEMOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3291618187" "There are more shipments coming so let's get this stuff sorted."

// OAKES_OILSPILL_SHIPMENT_CRATEMOVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2947373659" "Don't let them near the shipment!"
// OAKES_OILSPILL_SHIPMENT_CRATEMOVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4225816188" "No one gets access to the shipment.  Deal with it!"
// OAKES_OILSPILL_SHIPMENT_CRATEMOVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1087253654" "Take them out.  This shipment is highly valuable."
// OAKES_OILSPILL_SHIPMENT_CRATEMOVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2511986377" "We can't afford any shipment losses.  Clean up this mess!"

// OAKES_OILSPILL_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4022814801" "Just up and around the corner, we'll patrol through there."
// OAKES_OILSPILL_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3731865533" "Keep a watch, men, Oil Spill is littered with Family and Arachnos."
// OAKES_OILSPILL_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2450449556" "I saw some fish guy on my last patrol.  Did you guys see them?"
// OAKES_OILSPILL_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1229295704" "This is my third patrol shift today.  My legs are sore."
// OAKES_OILSPILL_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3875081956" "I hate patrolling at night.  I keep walking into oil slicks."

// OAKES_OILSPILL_PATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3902256025" "Use your training, Council!"
// OAKES_OILSPILL_PATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1306571735" "Finally!  Some action!"
// OAKES_OILSPILL_PATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1828794093" "Let's do this!"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_CREDENTIALSCHECK_INTERROGATEDNPC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3263818242" "Why are you asking me so many questions?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CREDENTIALSCHECK_INTERROGATEDNPC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3612016521" "Identification?  What kind of identification?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CREDENTIALSCHECK_INTERROGATEDNPC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4250079435" "What is it you want to know?  Why am I being detained?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CREDENTIALSCHECK_INTERROGATEDNPC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4069830933" "I am not showing you anything.  You show me a badge!"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_CREDENTIALSCHECK_INTERROGATEDNPC_ALERT_TEXT :
"P438815920" "I'm going back to Paragon City!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CREDENTIALSCHECK_INTERROGATEDNPC_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3021978333" "I'm calling my lawyer!  You can't treat me like this!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CREDENTIALSCHECK_INTERROGATEDNPC_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1757357629" "This is a travesty!"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_CREDENTIALSCHECK_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P248858300" "Citizen, you do not want to trifle with me.  Show me your identification.  Now."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CREDENTIALSCHECK_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P249693226" "This gets a lot more painful the longer you take to produce identification."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CREDENTIALSCHECK_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3218551526" "Be still.  Checking the manifest."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CREDENTIALSCHECK_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P760157336" "What is your business in Crimson Cove?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CREDENTIALSCHECK_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P894842456" "What is your destination?"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_CREDENTIALSCHECK_INTERROGATOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1139491898" "Men!  Let that one go!  We have a fight on our hands!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CREDENTIALSCHECK_INTERROGATOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1935240234" "We'll get him later!  Take care of this first!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CREDENTIALSCHECK_INTERROGATOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P414951862" "Fool!  You interrupting Council business was your first - and last - mistake!"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_VAMPIRIAMBUSH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3946016204" "A beautiful night for a bit of fun!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_VAMPIRIAMBUSH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2909486782" "Ah, this one will do nicely!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_VAMPIRIAMBUSH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3688538752" "Caught you unaware?  Ah, good.  Fear makes this so much more fun!"

// SHARKHEAD_PATROL_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2996720935" "Keep together, men.  We're not intimidating anyone if you're all wandering around like giggling schoolgirls."
// SHARKHEAD_PATROL_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3557343460" "Let's make another round."
// SHARKHEAD_PATROL_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4186399813" "You there.  Keep up."
// SHARKHEAD_PATROL_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1717344078" "Two more cycles and then we'll head back."

// SHARKHEAD_PATROL_COUNCIL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P67312250" "And now the patrol gets interesting."
// SHARKHEAD_PATROL_COUNCIL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3123296386" "Time to work!"
// SHARKHEAD_PATROL_COUNCIL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3357929703" "Okay, let's earn that pay, people!"

// SHARKHEAD_CHATTER_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1932681550" "I don't know.  It's just a feeling.  I think the Scrapyarders are up to something big."
// SHARKHEAD_CHATTER_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P514410522" "It's not Striga, but this base will suffice for now."
// SHARKHEAD_CHATTER_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P811615910" "I think the tunnels are coming along.  No one's really aware of them yet."
// SHARKHEAD_CHATTER_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2446364221" "Let the wolves and vampyri cause a stir tonight.  Things always get interesting when they're about."

// SHARKHEAD_CHATTER_COUNCIL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P966512022" "You've made a mistake!"
// SHARKHEAD_CHATTER_COUNCIL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3138945071" "You're in trouble now.  BIG trouble."
// SHARKHEAD_CHATTER_COUNCIL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P500771265" "You've breathed your last!"

// SHARKHEAD_COUNCIL_SHIPMENT_MOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3606023079" "These goods are important.  Be careful with them."
// SHARKHEAD_COUNCIL_SHIPMENT_MOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P729561574" "Watch your step and don't drop anything."
// SHARKHEAD_COUNCIL_SHIPMENT_MOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2091522012" "Put those boxes down over there."
// SHARKHEAD_COUNCIL_SHIPMENT_MOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1162180750" "We have to get these crates to the docks before dawn."
// SHARKHEAD_COUNCIL_SHIPMENT_MOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3077974390" "Ballistics? Check. Accelerant? Check."

// SHARKHEAD_COUNCIL_SHIPMENT_MOVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3855230344" "Drop everything!  ATTACK!"
// SHARKHEAD_COUNCIL_SHIPMENT_MOVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P127036792" "You think you can defeat the Council?!"
// SHARKHEAD_COUNCIL_SHIPMENT_MOVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3501194675" "Nevermind the shipment right now.  Just take care of this problem!"
// SHARKHEAD_COUNCIL_SHIPMENT_MOVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1524851264" "What are YOU doing here?"

// SHARKHEAD_COUNCIL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3577876216" "This shipment is too important to fall into the wrong hands."
// SHARKHEAD_COUNCIL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2051695763" "Nothing really big to report.  Bits of activity here and there.  The usual."
// SHARKHEAD_COUNCIL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1052980578" "Don't worry, the shipment is safe.  I'll let you know if anything comes up."

// SHARKHEAD_COUNCIL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1237033180" "The only way you're leaving is on a stretcher."
// SHARKHEAD_COUNCIL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3123033639" "We got some problems here.  No need for reinforcements."
// SHARKHEAD_COUNCIL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3085154675" "Here we go, boys!"

// SHARKHEAD_COUNCIL_GUARDSHIP_BINOCULARS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2538500520" "I see something coming this way."
// SHARKHEAD_COUNCIL_GUARDSHIP_BINOCULARS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3178375819" "Here we go!"
// SHARKHEAD_COUNCIL_GUARDSHIP_BINOCULARS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2246658755" "Send in backup!"
// SHARKHEAD_COUNCIL_GUARDSHIP_BINOCULARS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2192300994" "They came out of nowhere!"

// SHARKHEAD_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P787077272" "All clear here, sir."
// SHARKHEAD_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P739174606" "This assignment is going to get interesting.  I can feel it."
// SHARKHEAD_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3135947841" "Hey, send over some food.  We've been out here for hours."
// SHARKHEAD_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2560612690" "Let's swap with the team on the outer ridge.  They're itching for a change of scenery, too."

// SHARKHEAD_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P534836926" "We've got company!"
// SHARKHEAD_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1198502770" "Okay, this watch just became fun."
// SHARKHEAD_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2003580569" "Finally!  Some excitement!"

// SHARKHEAD_LOOKOUT_BINOCULARS_INACTIVE_TEXT_ :
"P2592508101" "You man the walkie talkie.  I'll man the binoculars.  Don't tell me how to look through glass and I won't tell you how to push a button."
// SHARKHEAD_LOOKOUT_BINOCULARS_INACTIVE_TEXT_ :
"P3874961419" "I see water.  Lots of it."
// SHARKHEAD_LOOKOUT_BINOCULARS_INACTIVE_TEXT_ :
"P2288500763" "Seriously.  Let's swap.  I'll let you have the binoculars if you'll let me work the walkie talkie."
// SHARKHEAD_LOOKOUT_BINOCULARS_INACTIVE_TEXT_ :
"P182988637" "Who put the black grease on these binoculars?  That's not even funny."

// SHARKHEAD_LOOKOUT_BINOCULARS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1764424524" "We've got a problem!"
// SHARKHEAD_LOOKOUT_BINOCULARS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P672454569" "Objects are definitely closer than they appear!  Incoming!"
// SHARKHEAD_LOOKOUT_BINOCULARS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4076777143" "We need assistance here!"

// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_COUNCIL_SELLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P285922837" "We've got the parts."
// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_COUNCIL_SELLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1726278896" "The parts are not a problem."
// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_COUNCIL_SELLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P400920502" "I can get that for you.  It won't be cheap, though."
// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_COUNCIL_SELLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3057614592" "Look, I hate you guys, but this deal is important.  If you could cool the hostility for five seconds we can finish this deal."
// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_COUNCIL_SELLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3829431234" "This goes no further than us.  If I find out you squealed to your superiors that we did business together, you'll regret it."

// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_COUNCIL_SELLER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2152887052" "I can't afford for anyone to see us together!  Waste 'em!"
// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_COUNCIL_SELLER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P758161423" "This is gonna hurt us both, Raider.  Let's waste 'em!"
// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_COUNCIL_SELLER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4245787116" "Finish the deal after we clean this mess up!"

// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_SKYRAIDERS_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P503795932" "Shhh...keep it down.  Fine.  Temporary detente."
// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_SKYRAIDERS_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4050752425" "If we can work together on this, we both benefit."
// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_SKYRAIDERS_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P87666173" "We can both benefit from this deal."
// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_SKYRAIDERS_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2505964617" "I think I can work with this."

// SHARKHEAD_COUNCIL_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1375326244" "Let's not get sloppy now.  Come on, men."
// SHARKHEAD_COUNCIL_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P155833211" "This may not be combat, but every move you make is being watched.  I'd advise care and attention to detail."
// SHARKHEAD_COUNCIL_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2341603733" "On my signal..."
// SHARKHEAD_COUNCIL_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4106968131" "Good.  Remember, precision is important."
// SHARKHEAD_COUNCIL_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3095842503" "Full inspections are never announced ahead of time.  I suggest you're always ready."

// SHARKHEAD_COUNCIL_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1437352719" "Put your training to use.  Let's go!"
// SHARKHEAD_COUNCIL_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P620172278" "Class dismissed!"
// SHARKHEAD_COUNCIL_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3066180811" "Forget maneuvers.  Time for some combat!"

// SHARKHEAD_COUNCIL_DRILLYELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2546152982" "You grunts will perform to your full potential!"
// SHARKHEAD_COUNCIL_DRILLYELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1351501342" "You there!  Get in sync!"
// SHARKHEAD_COUNCIL_DRILLYELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P223386382" "Now's not the time to test my patience.  Either get in line or back to the barracks!"

// SHARKHEAD_COUNCIL_DRILLYELL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3868978757" "This is not a drill!"
// SHARKHEAD_COUNCIL_DRILLYELL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2188284087" "Time for combat training.  Put your heart into it!"
// SHARKHEAD_COUNCIL_DRILLYELL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3768250182" "Attack!"

// SHARKHEAD_COUNCIL_WEAPONCHECK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1102232189" "It's like this.  You keep your equipment clean or you go back to latrine duty.  It's really very simple."
// SHARKHEAD_COUNCIL_WEAPONCHECK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P612527409" "Good work, soldier.  Very nice."
// SHARKHEAD_COUNCIL_WEAPONCHECK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3213046028" "Make them shine, men.  Impress me."
// SHARKHEAD_COUNCIL_WEAPONCHECK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P589941456" "You there.  Not good enough.  Clean it again."

// SHARKHEAD_MECH_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1934495422" "Primary Objective: Patrol for super-powered hostiles."

// SHARKHEAD_MECH_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2129392586" "Secondary Objective: Repel invaders with maximum force."
// SHARKHEAD_MECH_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P221492" "Target acquired."

// SHARKHEAD_GENERIC_CELLPHONE_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2476829320" "Yeah, I'm on duty.  I can't really talk.  Call you later?"
// SHARKHEAD_GENERIC_CELLPHONE_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P863586249" "I'm on a break, but I'm running out of time, so make it quick."
// SHARKHEAD_GENERIC_CELLPHONE_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3940038273" "Look, I'll call you later.  I need to get back to work."

// SHARKHEAD_GENERIC_CELLPHONE_COUNCIL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3291825010" "Gotta go.  I gotta take care of something."
// SHARKHEAD_GENERIC_CELLPHONE_COUNCIL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P72887812" "Gotta go.  Duty calls."
// SHARKHEAD_GENERIC_CELLPHONE_COUNCIL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P512959333" "Call you later, duty calls."

// SHARKHEAD_GENERIC_CELLPHONE_FAMILY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P154203780" "Yeah.  Got it.  I'll take care of it."
// SHARKHEAD_GENERIC_CELLPHONE_FAMILY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3884586797" "Uh huh.  Well he's dead.  Tell him I said he's dead.  Got it?"
// SHARKHEAD_GENERIC_CELLPHONE_FAMILY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2853498406" "He's a made man.  You can't touch him.  Let me handle it."
// SHARKHEAD_GENERIC_CELLPHONE_FAMILY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3667153207" "Trust me, I can make anything look like an accident.  I got it covered."

// SHARKHEAD_GENERIC_CELLPHONE_FAMILY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2600977927" "Gotta go.  I got something to do here."
// SHARKHEAD_GENERIC_CELLPHONE_FAMILY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1086368314" "Call you back.  I gotta take out the trash."
// SHARKHEAD_GENERIC_CELLPHONE_FAMILY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2850630817" "Can't you see I'm on a personal call here?"

// SHARKHEAD_MEKWELDING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1411606134" "I need to fine tune their programming.  They're not getting in close enough."
// SHARKHEAD_MEKWELDING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3411884360" "Hm...that one looks pretty good."
// SHARKHEAD_MEKWELDING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P896182511" "Excellent.  At this rate of efficiency, we'll be done by the end of the week."

// SHARKHEAD_MEKWELDING_INSTRUCTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2076287167" "Initiate secondary objective!"
// SHARKHEAD_MEKWELDING_INSTRUCTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2330601264" "Primary objective over-ride.  Switch to secondary objective!"
// SHARKHEAD_MEKWELDING_INSTRUCTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P372404184" "You're not supposed to be here!"



// SHARKHEAD_RIFLMEN_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P738362244" "I hate standing here.  Can't we just shoot something?"
// SHARKHEAD_RIFLMEN_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3244913556" "I wish some Sky Raiders would fly by.  I'd love to take a few pot shots at them."
// SHARKHEAD_RIFLMEN_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P784832947" "Seen any fledgling 'spiderlings' around?  Maybe we could use them as target practice."

// SHARKHEAD_RIFLMEN_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1884623549" "Finally!  Something to shoot at!"
// SHARKHEAD_RIFLMEN_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3814969821" "Yes!  About time some action started!"
// SHARKHEAD_RIFLMEN_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P698963021" "Finally some action!"

// SHARKHEAD_TARGETPRACTICE_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3579908323" "You want to hit the target in the middle.  Not everything but the little black dot."
// SHARKHEAD_TARGETPRACTICE_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3137109224" "Good.  Now hit the target."
// SHARKHEAD_TARGETPRACTICE_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P338320121" "I know you can fire a weapon.  Have we gone over accuracy?"
// SHARKHEAD_TARGETPRACTICE_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3363494797" "You guys are 33 percent less accurate than you were last month.  What's up with that?"
// SHARKHEAD_TARGETPRACTICE_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3432848654" "Just pretend that's Positron you're shooting at."

// SHARKHEAD_TARGETPRACTICE_INSTRUCTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2882916230" "New targets, guys!"
// SHARKHEAD_TARGETPRACTICE_INSTRUCTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P362340419" "We're graduating to moving targets!"
// SHARKHEAD_TARGETPRACTICE_INSTRUCTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P339046695" "Okay, practice is over.  Now for the final!"

// SHARKHEAD_VAMPYRI_AMBUSH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2083038854" "Time to play!"
// SHARKHEAD_VAMPYRI_AMBUSH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1235460676" "Ah, now what have we here?"
// SHARKHEAD_VAMPYRI_AMBUSH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P868692042" "Time for some fun!"

// SHARKHEAD_VAMPYRI_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3268586849" "I feel like causing some pain tonight."
// SHARKHEAD_VAMPYRI_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P702549049" "Ah...night-time.  My favorite part of the day."
// SHARKHEAD_VAMPYRI_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P890319837" "What do I see?  Opportunity for chaos."
// SHARKHEAD_VAMPYRI_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3846228026" "The time is right for a little chaos."

// SHARKHEAD_VAMPYRI_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3534219515" "Ah, look!  A victim!"
// SHARKHEAD_VAMPYRI_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1700954617" "Dinner has arrived!  I love my meat rare."

// SHARKHEAD_VAMPYRI_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2361681477" "Following you, brethren.  This should be an interesting stroll."
// SHARKHEAD_VAMPYRI_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3931872004" "Let's stroll about until we find something that intrigues us."
// SHARKHEAD_VAMPYRI_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P29180798" "Right behind you, friend."
// SHARKHEAD_VAMPYRI_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P70413890" "Let's head down the way further until we come upon an opportunity for mischief."
// SHARKHEAD_VAMPYRI_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P369285646" "What a pretty neck you have...oh, sorry."

// SHARKHEAD_VAMPYRI_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1711409284" "Looks like the mischief came to us.  How fortuitous."
// SHARKHEAD_VAMPYRI_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2511698677" "Look!  A plaything.  Let's rip it to shreds."
// SHARKHEAD_VAMPYRI_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P35329422" "I see some fun making its way toward us."

// SHARKHEAD_COUNCIL_WEAPONCHECK_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1195012667" "Unsatisfactory.  Check it again."
// SHARKHEAD_COUNCIL_WEAPONCHECK_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2149009423" "However you decide to maintain your weapon is up to you.  But I'm not carrying you to the infirmary if it discharges in your face."
// SHARKHEAD_COUNCIL_WEAPONCHECK_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2686261958" "Did you clean that with a bag of dirt?"
// SHARKHEAD_COUNCIL_WEAPONCHECK_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P84435137" "Uh...right.  I'm not impressed.  Take it apart and clean every single piece."

// SHARKHEAD_COUNCIL_WEAPONCHECK_INSTRUCTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3779987493" "Shoot 'em if you got 'em!"
// SHARKHEAD_COUNCIL_WEAPONCHECK_INSTRUCTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3332722587" "Instruction is over!  Time for combat!"
// SHARKHEAD_COUNCIL_WEAPONCHECK_INSTRUCTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1186584497" "Forget the lesson...time to fight!"

// NERVA_5TH_WALKIETALKIE_CAPTURED_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1131643829" "Now he has no choice but to join us."
// NERVA_5TH_WALKIETALKIE_CAPTURED_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3572339341" "Point has been taken.  What are your orders, Commander?"
// NERVA_5TH_WALKIETALKIE_CAPTURED_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P299345976" "We have captured one for questioning.  Send in a specialist."
// NERVA_5TH_WALKIETALKIE_CAPTURED_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3488153802" "His vitals appear to be normal."
// NERVA_5TH_WALKIETALKIE_CAPTURED_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2264724977" "We'll bring him in right away, commander."
// NERVA_5TH_WALKIETALKIE_CAPTURED_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P663966396" "We will hold this point and wait for extraction."
// NERVA_5TH_WALKIETALKIE_CAPTURED_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4289995766" "Thank you, sir.  Glory to the 5th Column."
// NERVA_5TH_WALKIETALKIE_CAPTURED_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2623465597" "He was not a loyalist.  We were ambushed, but they were no match for the 5th Column."
// NERVA_5TH_WALKIETALKIE_CAPTURED_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3801410968" "Should we eliminate him or bring him in for experimentation?"
// NERVA_5TH_WALKIETALKIE_CAPTURED_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P764049055" "Hello?  Hello?  Someone is jamming our radio!"

// NERVA_5TH_WALKIETALKIE_CAPTURED_VICTIM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1662481340" "Interlopers!  Attack!"
// NERVA_5TH_WALKIETALKIE_CAPTURED_VICTIM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1002591991" "This one is ours, go get your own hostage!"
// NERVA_5TH_WALKIETALKIE_CAPTURED_VICTIM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P671765051" "The 5th Column shall not fall again!"
// NERVA_5TH_WALKIETALKIE_CAPTURED_VICTIM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3724871263" "You are too late!"
// NERVA_5TH_WALKIETALKIE_CAPTURED_VICTIM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P972473343" "Sir, we are under attack.  Send reinforcements!"
// NERVA_5TH_WALKIETALKIE_CAPTURED_VICTIM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P968126736" "Just a moment, sir.  This won't take long."
// NERVA_5TH_WALKIETALKIE_CAPTURED_VICTIM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2868308989" "It's a set up!"
// NERVA_5TH_WALKIETALKIE_CAPTURED_VICTIM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2191618166" "Code red!  We have a code red!"

// NERVA_5TH_PERCH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3006975550" "No problem."
// NERVA_5TH_PERCH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1300794665" "This will be quick."
// NERVA_5TH_PERCH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3395641169" "Fool!  Do not interfere with the 5th Column!"
// NERVA_5TH_PERCH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1398878676" "You just signed your own death warrant."
// NERVA_5TH_PERCH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2248267694" "Leave no witnesses."

// SHARKHEAD_5TH_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1627180857" "Soon, all this will be ours."
// SHARKHEAD_5TH_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3775255571" "It's good to be back."
// SHARKHEAD_5TH_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3973824299" "Keep an eye out for trouble."

// SHARKHEAD_5TH_CHATTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P254408578" "Here it goes again."
// SHARKHEAD_5TH_CHATTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1069002019" "Wha... Attack!"
// SHARKHEAD_5TH_CHATTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1569043428" "We've been spotted.  Fire!"
// SHARKHEAD_5TH_CHATTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3908076032" "Nice of you to join us!"
// SHARKHEAD_5TH_CHATTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2659348169" "Welcome to painville."
// SHARKHEAD_5TH_CHATTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1169020970" "Don't even think about it."
// SHARKHEAD_5TH_CHATTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3868692506" "Don't mess with the 5th Column."
// SHARKHEAD_5TH_CHATTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2975345951" "We've got your number.  Now sit down."
// SHARKHEAD_5TH_CHATTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3249808139" "You've messed up bad, and now you'll pay."
// SHARKHEAD_5TH_CHATTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4110781961" "You don't belong here.  This is our town."

// SHARKHEAD_5TH_SHIPMENT_MOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3336819077" "Move it!"
// SHARKHEAD_5TH_SHIPMENT_MOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3431746375" "These are the right crates.  Let's go."
// SHARKHEAD_5TH_SHIPMENT_MOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2339879080" "These boxes are volatile.  Be careful with them."

// SHARKHEAD_5TH_SHIPMENT_MOVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3165925286" "Defend the shipment at all costs!"
// SHARKHEAD_5TH_SHIPMENT_MOVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2125930947" "Never fails, just when we get all loaded up, someone comes to spoil our day."
// SHARKHEAD_5TH_SHIPMENT_MOVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P793121317" "The 5th Column will not sway nor give.  You will fail this day."
// SHARKHEAD_5TH_SHIPMENT_MOVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3408268791" "Forget the shipment, destroy the interloper!"
// SHARKHEAD_5TH_SHIPMENT_MOVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3464332506" "You have come to join us?  No?  This will not end well for you."
// SHARKHEAD_5TH_SHIPMENT_MOVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2287420349" "Incoming threat.  Destroy it."
// SHARKHEAD_5TH_SHIPMENT_MOVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4066896932" "Join the 5th Column.  That is the only way."
// SHARKHEAD_5TH_SHIPMENT_MOVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P740060951" "Destroy the detractors.  We reclaim our legacy NOW!"
// SHARKHEAD_5TH_SHIPMENT_MOVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P863653842" "You cannot hope to win."

// SHARKHEAD_5TH_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3634714354" "The situation is not as previously reported.  Send in a specialist."
// SHARKHEAD_5TH_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2012600480" "We will hold this point and await extraction."
// SHARKHEAD_5TH_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3087267654" "Yes sir.  <em>No sir.  <em>I don't know.  <em><em>Yes sir."
// SHARKHEAD_5TH_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1775268244" "The target has been spotted."


// SHARKHEAD_5TH_BINOCS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2293636829" "I see him.  Hold this position."
// SHARKHEAD_5TH_BINOCS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2205725566" "Alpha Team, this is Delta Team. The coast is clear."
// SHARKHEAD_5TH_BINOCS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1928166136" "The target is on the move."
// SHARKHEAD_5TH_BINOCS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2016359500" "Cover me."
// SHARKHEAD_5TH_BINOCS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2313392079" "This is going to be easy."
// SHARKHEAD_5TH_BINOCS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P979825647" "I see the target.  Everything is going as planned."

// SHARKHEAD_5TH_BINOCS_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P525308724" "You want a peek?  Too bad."

// SHARKHEAD_5TH_GUARDSUPPLIES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P87352134" "The commander needs all of these boxes moved over there."
// SHARKHEAD_5TH_GUARDSUPPLIES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4177375542" "This must be the shipment."




// STEEL_5TH_ALLHOODS_AMBUSHBYCOUNCIL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2387108084" "Yes, the 5th Column is back.  And now we will wipe out the unfaithful!"
// STEEL_5TH_ALLHOODS_AMBUSHBYCOUNCIL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1511434529" "You cannot hope to prevail against us now."
// STEEL_5TH_ALLHOODS_AMBUSHBYCOUNCIL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2484572163" "The Council is weak, we will crush you."
// STEEL_5TH_ALLHOODS_AMBUSHBYCOUNCIL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3416880349" "Fools!  You didn't think we were really gone, did you?"
// STEEL_5TH_ALLHOODS_AMBUSHBYCOUNCIL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3841150672" "Our hour of vengeance is at hand."
// STEEL_5TH_ALLHOODS_AMBUSHBYCOUNCIL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P705411831" "Join us and you may be spared."
// STEEL_5TH_ALLHOODS_AMBUSHBYCOUNCIL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3141979681" "The 5th Column is back.  You cannot prevail."
// STEEL_5TH_ALLHOODS_AMBUSHBYCOUNCIL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2685932787" "I make this outfit look good."
// STEEL_5TH_ALLHOODS_AMBUSHBYCOUNCIL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P599807394" "Our new leader will take us to the bright future."
// STEEL_5TH_ALLHOODS_AMBUSHBYCOUNCIL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1645702475" "You think Striga Isle is a base of operations?  Our headquarters is in the middle of Paragon City!"
// STEEL_5TH_ALLHOODS_AMBUSHBYCOUNCIL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3648860770" "You may have gained a handhold here, but we will crush you!"

